WEBVTT

00:02.960 --> 00:05.460
Is everyone well-rested?

00:05.460 --> 00:06.920
We rested too much.

00:06.920 --> 00:10.920
Unlike you, we got pathetically
beat down right off the bat.

00:11.210 --> 00:13.750
Did you get any rest, Major?

00:13.750 --> 00:15.380
Your concern is unnecessary.

00:15.380 --> 00:16.460
Go to bed already, baldy!

00:16.460 --> 00:17.710
A certain swordmaster hit me so hard
Go to bed already, baldy!<b></b>

00:17.710 --> 00:18.830
A certain swordmaster hit me so hard

00:18.830 --> 00:21.380
I passed out for half the day.

00:21.580 --> 00:23.250
It was effective, wasn't it?

00:23.670 --> 00:26.330
First, let's discuss the capital's
current state.

00:26.330 --> 00:29.880
Five hours ago, Lady Nazarena
went to the capital for us.

00:32.170 --> 00:33.880
All the city's citizens are dead.

00:35.630 --> 00:40.040
A giant tree is there and is absorbing
nutrients from their veins.

00:40.580 --> 00:43.790
The Old District and New District
are both piles of rubble.

00:44.290 --> 00:47.790
Comparatively, the Palace District
is uncannily undamaged.

00:47.790 --> 00:49.000
Additionally...

00:49.540 --> 00:53.170
I felt an upsurge in silverine
in one area in the Palace District.

00:53.790 --> 00:56.630
It was the light of Embodied Restraints.

00:57.210 --> 00:59.380
I believe Her Highness is located there.

00:59.710 --> 01:02.880
Hooray! Woohoo!

01:03.380 --> 01:05.630
We also think the Winged Monarch
is there too.

01:06.130 --> 01:10.040
The objective of this operation
is to rescue Her Highness

01:10.040 --> 01:12.290
and kill the Winged Monarch.

01:16.290 --> 01:19.750
They have likely already discovered
our teleportation circles.

01:20.130 --> 01:22.670
The enemy has a tight surveillance network.

01:22.670 --> 01:25.210
I managed to slip through it.

01:25.500 --> 01:29.380
But if an enemy has great enough capabilities
to maintain a tight surveillance network,

01:30.250 --> 01:35.710
would they actually miss magic circles
that had already been placed?

01:36.960 --> 01:39.250
It's a trap, in all probability.

01:39.250 --> 01:41.580
We're all aware of the fact
and need not say so.

01:41.580 --> 01:43.250
And yet we must go anyway.

01:44.000 --> 01:46.380
If we don't win this fight,

01:46.380 --> 01:49.290
we'll have nowhere else to go!

02:17.540 --> 02:19.420
Ikiru imi sae

02:19.420 --> 02:21.580
Ubaisatteitta

02:21.580 --> 02:23.790
Ibitsuna sekai o

02:23.790 --> 02:26.630
Zenbu kowasou to shiteita

02:26.630 --> 02:28.710
(Subete o hikikae ni)

02:28.710 --> 02:30.880
Chikara o motometa

02:30.880 --> 02:33.000
(Daishou no hate ni)

02:33.000 --> 02:36.000
Nani ga matteita toshitemo

02:36.420 --> 02:40.460
Mirai o kaeru tame ni

02:40.460 --> 02:43.500
Jibun o tokihanatte

02:43.500 --> 02:45.630
Kotae wa dare ni mo

02:45.630 --> 02:47.750
Wakari nado shinai

02:47.750 --> 02:49.580
Dakara jibun de

02:49.580 --> 02:51.880
Kirihiraite yukunda

02:52.170 --> 02:54.210
Aragai nagara

02:54.210 --> 02:56.460
Sagashite ita mono wa

02:56.460 --> 03:00.210
Kibou demo kiseki demo naku tada

03:00.210 --> 03:02.210
Boku wa ima

03:02.210 --> 03:07.830
Kimi to ikiru imi ga hoshii dake

03:21.210 --> 03:24.170
<b>Episode 20: Just Watch Me</b>

03:21.580 --> 03:23.790
Four superior dragons are left.

03:24.380 --> 03:28.710
But it is not absolutely necessary
to defeat all four of them.

03:29.170 --> 03:31.830
If you kill the monarch,
the heart of the bloodline,

03:31.830 --> 03:34.330
the superior dragons will die off,
since they are the limbs.

03:34.830 --> 03:37.420
An account of this is given in the scripture.

03:37.710 --> 03:39.920
Isn't that right, Master Ragna?

03:40.920 --> 03:42.460
I don't care about the scripture.

03:42.670 --> 03:44.080
But it's true.

03:44.460 --> 03:46.580
I'll handle Woltekamui.

03:46.960 --> 03:49.250
While I'm tied up with him,
you guys will hunt the Winged Monarch.

03:49.250 --> 03:52.170
Why're you hiding behind the corner?

03:55.130 --> 03:57.250
I hate being the center of attention.

03:57.250 --> 04:00.710
After you went nuts on the battlefield?
Yeah, sure you hate it!

04:01.250 --> 04:02.500
Get over here!

04:03.170 --> 04:05.000
Why do ya look like you're gonna puke?

04:05.880 --> 04:08.830
Do you have any countermeasures
for Time Control Magic?

04:08.830 --> 04:11.000
Yes, of course!

04:11.000 --> 04:15.040
Controlling time is not a special power
exclusive to the Winged Monarch.

04:15.040 --> 04:16.960
And as for the civilians...

04:16.960 --> 04:21.290
Yes. The church will assume
responsibility for them.

04:21.290 --> 04:25.500
Our duty is to ensure you heroes can fight

04:25.500 --> 04:27.750
without any apprehension!

04:27.750 --> 04:28.920
Thank you.

04:29.330 --> 04:30.750
Hesela.

04:30.750 --> 04:32.580
You stay here.

04:34.630 --> 04:38.290
To be blunt, you don't look like
you're in any condition to fight.

04:38.290 --> 04:41.460
Besides, unlike the rest of us,

04:41.460 --> 04:45.040
you didn't choose to spend
your life fighting.

04:46.460 --> 04:48.330
Let this be it for you.

04:48.330 --> 04:49.710
We can take it from he-

04:49.710 --> 04:50.540
No.

04:51.170 --> 04:55.670
Because Greya died, I don't know
what I'm supposed to feel anymore.

04:55.670 --> 04:56.920
That's why I'm going.

04:57.960 --> 05:00.290
All right. Sorry.

05:02.250 --> 05:04.080
We'll start in two hours.

05:04.080 --> 05:06.290
That's when the sun rises over the capital.

05:06.290 --> 05:08.580
I want every one of you to be ready by then.

05:08.580 --> 05:11.500
What? Why aren't we going now?

05:17.210 --> 05:18.380
Sir Ragna.

05:21.170 --> 05:23.460
May I speak to you for a moment?

05:25.250 --> 05:27.790
Is your body truly healed?

05:28.080 --> 05:29.460
Sir Ike was surprised and said,

05:29.460 --> 05:33.420
"The Reaper went to take a crap and
somehow came back fully recovered."

05:33.420 --> 05:34.290
Huh?

05:34.290 --> 05:35.880
Oh, yeah.

05:36.130 --> 05:38.130
Crapping rehabilitated me.

05:38.130 --> 05:39.670
That's wonderful.

05:40.920 --> 05:45.380
To follow in Sir Shin's footsteps,
may I ask for a one-on-on lesson?

06:02.830 --> 06:04.210
Superb!

06:04.580 --> 06:06.290
You took me by surprise.

06:06.290 --> 06:07.670
You're stronger now.

06:07.670 --> 06:09.670
I thought so as well.

06:09.670 --> 06:12.380
However, the end result was
the same as last time.

06:12.380 --> 06:15.040
You, too, have grown even stronger.

06:15.040 --> 06:18.630
Or rather, you've become
accustomed to your strength.

06:19.460 --> 06:21.960
When someone is making observations
with their life in peril,

06:21.960 --> 06:24.040
there are certain things
one takes notice of.

06:24.710 --> 06:25.880
That's true!

06:25.880 --> 06:27.960
It wasn't my strength to begin with!

06:27.960 --> 06:29.250
It was gifted to me!

06:29.250 --> 06:30.710
Did you realize that?

06:30.710 --> 06:32.710
You seem awfully happy about this.

06:32.710 --> 06:33.710
Huh?

06:34.130 --> 06:36.670
Uh... Yeah.

06:37.540 --> 06:38.790
I'm happy about it.

06:40.500 --> 06:43.040
I wasn't the one who put in the hard work,

06:43.040 --> 06:45.790
yet I was being treated like
some amazing guy.

06:45.790 --> 06:47.210
It felt wrong.

06:47.630 --> 06:51.040
It's difficult to feel proud of that.

06:53.710 --> 06:55.960
That jellylike individual...

06:55.960 --> 06:58.170
What was his name again?

06:58.170 --> 07:00.130
Puru, puru!

07:00.130 --> 07:01.130
Oh.

07:01.460 --> 07:02.920
You're talking about Mister Slime?

07:02.920 --> 07:03.920
Yes.

07:03.920 --> 07:05.580
That Sir Mister fellow.

07:05.580 --> 07:07.080
Where is he now?

07:07.080 --> 07:08.710
He's still crapping.

07:10.210 --> 07:12.670
When Taratectra bombarded us,

07:12.670 --> 07:17.170
you tried to have Sir Mister shield
myself and Sir Shin.

07:18.040 --> 07:21.290
But I slipped through Sir Mister's grasp

07:21.830 --> 07:23.880
to chase after you.

07:26.750 --> 07:28.580
Then I saw you cut through the blast.

07:28.920 --> 07:31.130
It was not magic alone.

07:31.630 --> 07:35.630
It was heat, impact, and even sound.

07:37.380 --> 07:40.500
Magic generated these
changes in the world.

07:40.500 --> 07:42.460
You stood your ground
against this six times,

07:42.460 --> 07:44.000
slashing and shattering each one.

07:44.380 --> 07:48.710
I believe you could have
squeezed past alone,

07:48.710 --> 07:53.420
but you deliberately faced them head-on
to protect us who were behind you.

07:53.420 --> 07:56.920
I decided to imitate that.

07:58.580 --> 08:02.080
It was only the remnant of what you cut,

08:02.080 --> 08:07.790
but it was enough to reduce
a person to dust, and I also cut it.

08:08.290 --> 08:09.500
I was able to!

08:10.330 --> 08:15.000
Sir Ragna, even if you feel lonely
and don't feel proud of yourself,

08:15.000 --> 08:19.670
please continue leading us
and showing us your strength!

08:20.290 --> 08:25.960
Many people will be compelled by your
strength to surpass their own limits.

08:26.580 --> 08:31.000
Perhaps someone else will reach
the same heights as you.

08:31.830 --> 08:35.540
I intend on being the first person
to achieve that.

08:45.670 --> 08:50.500
A future where lots of people
become as strong as me...

08:54.670 --> 08:56.000
That would be nice.

08:56.630 --> 08:58.830
I'd like to experience that future.

09:03.170 --> 09:04.580
Is everyone here?

09:09.960 --> 09:13.460
I had her take loads of drugs,
so she won't wake up for a hot minute.

09:13.710 --> 09:16.540
Mmm... Princess...

09:17.670 --> 09:20.710
All right, good luck with the church.

09:20.710 --> 09:23.130
Please don't leave us, Master Fu!

09:23.130 --> 09:25.750
Master Fu, haven't you done
enough already?

09:25.750 --> 09:29.500
Master Fu, you're best suited for
researching magic, not fighting!

09:29.500 --> 09:32.130
Join the Solarians with us!

09:33.130 --> 09:34.000
Fu.

09:35.080 --> 09:36.540
Thanks.

09:36.540 --> 09:38.290
Take care of that uggo for me.

09:39.420 --> 09:42.420
I'm in agreement with their opinion.

09:42.420 --> 09:46.670
I'm sure you'd flourish as
a researcher for the church.

09:46.880 --> 09:49.500
Sorry, not interested.

09:49.790 --> 09:52.540
Don't want anyone but her to be my boss.

09:55.420 --> 09:56.710
Teleportation...

09:56.710 --> 09:57.830
Activate.

10:03.830 --> 10:06.960
Now, let us play our role.

10:17.920 --> 10:19.170
What is this?

10:19.170 --> 10:23.170
We are executing a countermeasure
against Time Control Magic.

10:23.170 --> 10:24.290
Three minutes.

10:24.290 --> 10:29.170
We guarantee only three minutes of
stopped time in which you can act.

10:30.380 --> 10:33.080
It will be ineffective against
Master Ragna,

10:33.080 --> 10:35.000
thus we will exclude him.

10:36.580 --> 10:38.330
Lady Carula! Your face!

10:39.000 --> 10:40.750
You need not be concerned.

10:41.080 --> 10:45.130
This is what controlling time
in human form involves.

10:45.880 --> 10:47.920
We must be ready in numbers,

10:47.920 --> 10:49.920
rely on tools,

10:49.920 --> 10:52.960
and deplete every last drop of life

10:52.960 --> 10:55.420
to finally actualize our will.

11:00.000 --> 11:02.130
The purpose of our existence

11:02.130 --> 11:07.210
is to provide maximum support
to those who fight dragons.

11:10.130 --> 11:14.330
Take care, dragon-slaying heroes.

11:14.540 --> 11:20.710
Let our lives bring you
the greatest return in battle.

11:34.000 --> 11:35.420
They're here.

11:52.380 --> 11:54.210
The sun isn't rising?

12:10.250 --> 12:13.250
What exactly do you think
you're doing, Zora?

12:13.750 --> 12:18.130
Darling Tara fought for the
progenitor's sake until his last breath.

12:20.080 --> 12:23.330
Thus, I shall also protect Tia
until my last breath.

12:23.330 --> 12:25.790
I'll butcher the Argentum Corps.

12:26.710 --> 12:28.710
Don't try to interfere!

12:32.880 --> 12:34.790
That's cool with me.

12:35.210 --> 12:38.000
If you wanna kill 'em, have at it.

12:38.330 --> 12:41.750
I know who I'm taking on, of course.

12:41.750 --> 12:43.830
Sir Reaper, go!

12:46.750 --> 12:48.960
That's what this means, Borgie.

12:48.960 --> 12:52.750
Ready yourself for the scum that will
take advantage of this opening.

12:53.170 --> 12:56.580
That's the final counsel I can give you
as the winged strategist.

12:58.670 --> 13:00.080
This feeling...

13:00.250 --> 13:01.420
Elder.

13:01.420 --> 13:02.880
Something is coming.

13:02.880 --> 13:04.250
Where are they?

13:05.040 --> 13:06.460
Up there?

13:08.330 --> 13:10.920
So they haven't stopped time?

13:11.500 --> 13:14.290
The most powerful application
of freezing time is...

13:15.290 --> 13:20.500
to use it right when the enemy appears.

13:21.460 --> 13:24.040
If they haven't stopped time,

13:24.040 --> 13:26.130
it means they can't.

13:40.000 --> 13:41.330
Spatial Connection?

13:46.290 --> 13:47.330
This reaction...

13:47.330 --> 13:48.540
That's not a living creature!

13:48.540 --> 13:49.670
Elder!

13:58.130 --> 14:00.330
You came just like I thought
you would, Crimson!

14:22.710 --> 14:24.500
Damn you, dragons!

14:24.500 --> 14:28.790
I will fire upon the enemies of
the capital's innocent civilians!

14:29.210 --> 14:31.540
Would it kill you to be quiet?

14:31.540 --> 14:34.210
I can't believe I have to
fight alongside you.

14:34.210 --> 14:35.920
It disgusts me.

14:39.710 --> 14:40.920
Very well.

14:40.920 --> 14:42.250
Do as you wish.

14:48.250 --> 14:51.330
As my death draws near,
I feel my blood stirring.

14:51.960 --> 14:54.080
After all, I am a dragon.

15:12.630 --> 15:15.670
I will not interfere with your fight.

15:16.210 --> 15:19.420
But as you can see, I am ginormous.

15:20.000 --> 15:23.460
I cannot be held responsible
if I crush all of you.

15:38.330 --> 15:40.420
First, say your goodbyes.

15:40.420 --> 15:41.540
I'll wait.

15:42.580 --> 15:44.880
Who is...

15:46.460 --> 15:48.830
there?

15:53.960 --> 15:54.880
Lia!

15:57.250 --> 15:59.250
Ragna...?

16:02.960 --> 16:05.670
The Silverware Princess will die shortly.

16:05.920 --> 16:09.960
Even if you kill me,
there is no way to stop the poison.

16:09.960 --> 16:11.790
Where is his real body?

16:12.040 --> 16:14.750
You will lose your master.

16:15.170 --> 16:18.880
I'm just taking my anger out on you.

16:22.290 --> 16:27.790
You will know the same anguish
I'm suffering!

16:36.540 --> 16:39.580
What can I do for someone
who is about to die?

16:41.790 --> 16:43.880
Ragna...

16:44.250 --> 16:47.710
She's at death's door, her life is
slipping away from her cold body.

16:47.710 --> 16:49.580
Yes, it's me.

16:49.580 --> 16:51.790
I came for you. I promised I would.

16:51.790 --> 16:52.880
What do I do?

16:52.880 --> 16:54.420
Freeze the poison?

16:54.420 --> 16:55.960
I'll freeze Lia.

16:56.210 --> 16:57.880
Maybe the Solarians...?

16:57.880 --> 16:59.380
Maybe Crimson could...

16:59.670 --> 17:01.210
There's no time.

17:03.250 --> 17:04.880
Take... that.

17:11.290 --> 17:15.580
A long, long time ago, a silver star
flew in from the cosmos.

17:16.080 --> 17:19.500
It is the origin of all silver.

17:21.540 --> 17:23.170
The Silver Comet!

17:23.630 --> 17:25.960
I'm sorry...

17:26.250 --> 17:34.920
You kept your promise, and I couldn't.

17:35.880 --> 17:37.420
I failed.

17:37.920 --> 17:41.460
I could not create
a better sword than that.

17:42.040 --> 17:44.080
I was inadequate.

17:44.080 --> 17:46.000
In every way!

17:48.330 --> 17:53.420
I couldn't... accomplish my ideal at all.

17:54.920 --> 17:57.460
Lia! That's enough! Enou-

17:57.460 --> 17:59.920
You cannot win with this.

18:00.830 --> 18:05.330
This sword has no chance of withstanding
that demonic sword.

18:06.000 --> 18:07.540
Next time...

18:07.540 --> 18:10.630
Next time I'll make a better sword.

18:10.630 --> 18:12.290
This failure wi-

18:14.460 --> 18:16.170
Next time...

18:16.670 --> 18:20.790
I will forge a sword that is worthy of you!

18:20.790 --> 18:22.000
But...

18:22.500 --> 18:25.750
There won't be a next time for me.

18:28.380 --> 18:31.000
I want us both to survive
and laugh together.

18:31.380 --> 18:35.380
If that can't happen, what can I do
for her before she dies?

18:35.960 --> 18:40.750
Please continue leading us and
showing us your strength!

18:42.250 --> 18:44.000
Just watch me!

18:44.710 --> 18:47.500
I constantly felt you
before I came here, Lia.

18:47.790 --> 18:50.580
I feel you even more deeply
with this sword in my hand.

18:50.830 --> 18:52.630
It's the same for you, isn't it?

18:52.630 --> 18:54.000
This is a good sword.

18:54.000 --> 18:55.710
I'll win with this sword.

18:55.710 --> 18:59.290
I'll win against that demonic sword
and hunt Woltekamui with it.

18:59.290 --> 19:01.080
Even if you can't see me,
I'll shine so brightly

19:01.080 --> 19:02.790
that you'll see me as clear as day!

19:13.330 --> 19:15.880
If you die, I'll feel grief.

19:16.630 --> 19:18.920
But I'll still be happy I met you.

19:19.790 --> 19:23.000
So just watch me until the end.

19:27.670 --> 19:30.580
From this point on,
I'll be stronger than...

19:31.540 --> 19:33.080
my future self!

19:43.170 --> 19:44.670
Finished?

19:44.670 --> 19:46.040
Hurry up and turn into a dragon.

19:46.040 --> 19:47.540
Don't rush me.

19:47.540 --> 19:50.250
First, we gotta pick up
where we left off last time.

19:50.250 --> 19:51.380
Did ya know?

19:51.880 --> 19:55.460
This Claw changes its characteristics
to match its wielder.

19:55.460 --> 19:59.670
The moment I picked up the Lightning Claw
is when it became the Lightning Claw.

20:00.040 --> 20:02.500
Its power is lightning-fast expansion
and transformation!

20:02.500 --> 20:05.210
That's my sword for you.

20:16.250 --> 20:21.460
Next, I'll thrust it in your direction
with everything I've got.

20:21.460 --> 20:24.380
How powerful will it be? Just imagine it.

20:25.670 --> 20:27.380
Hurry up and turn into a dragon.

20:27.380 --> 20:31.000
I let you ready yourself and get into
perfect condition with your best weapon.

20:31.000 --> 20:34.460
If you seriously drop dead after
a single thrust, I'm so gonna kill you!

20:34.460 --> 20:36.170
Hurry up and turn into a dragon.

20:53.380 --> 20:54.960
This was...

20:54.960 --> 20:56.790
worth it after all!

21:02.420 --> 21:03.920
Turn into a dragon.

21:11.540 --> 21:15.830
I want you to be in your mightiest form
when I crush you.

21:25.750 --> 21:27.290
I get it now.

21:27.290 --> 21:31.710
If my Claw is a sword that reaches
100% in its wielder's hands,

21:31.710 --> 21:38.170
then his sword pushes
its wielder to 120%.

21:40.880 --> 21:43.080
Forget the small talk.

22:05.750 --> 22:07.960
Let's get on with the carnage!

22:25.880 --> 22:32.920
Honshou wa kakushiteiru tsubasa no uchi ni,
mudana agaki to shitte mo

22:32.920 --> 22:39.630
Kodoku kara naru itami sae taete izure
tayorinai mirai, kibou

22:39.630 --> 22:43.420
Raisan o kumo ni suru kuuchuusen,
yokkyuu oshikorosu koujou ja

22:43.420 --> 22:46.710
Ibitsuna katachi shika umi enai

22:46.710 --> 22:53.670
Akegata, higashi kara noboru hikari o
watashi no mono ni nante wagamama

22:53.670 --> 22:57.790
Aimaina kotoba ja todokanai hodo

22:57.790 --> 23:06.130
Kurakute mabushii tokoro made
shinjitai to dou ieba ii

23:06.790 --> 23:11.290
Hada de kanjita ima iki o tsuiteiru koto sae

23:11.290 --> 23:15.420
Houridaseru youna netsu ga mi o yaite mo

23:15.420 --> 23:22.000
Ano machi e kaeru tame
no hane ga mou sukoshi oshii

23:22.000 --> 23:29.500
Ah, kono mama doko made mo iketara
soko wa atatakai basho de

23:29.500 --> 23:34.210
Fureru ni wa mada yawarakai mama da
